 — John Carroll University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor campus landmark adjacent to the library area; weather-dependent and no seating or hours are specified on the source.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jcu-sabo-center-oc101","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Sabo Center for Languages and Cultures","title":"Sabo Center for Languages and Cultures","subtitle":"OC 101, O’Malley Center","notes":"Bring a laptop or use one of the workstations for language and culture coursework; keep food outside this technology-centered academic space.","short_summary":"A flexible academic workspace with 24 computer stations and printing.","evidence_claim":"John Carroll says the Sabo Center in OC 101 has 24 computer workstations, flexible collaborative furniture, device tables, and a printing station.","source_url":"https://www.jcu.edu/academics/centers/sabo-center-for-languages-and-cultures/index","source_title":"Sabo Center for Languages and Cultures — John Carroll University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open during standard University business hours, 8 AM–5 PM Monday–Friday; outside-hour reservations require contacting the center. Food is not permitted.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jcu-amlc-multimedia-library-oc139","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"AMLC Multimedia Library","title":"AMLC Multimedia Library","subtitle":"OC 139, O’Malley Center","notes":"Reserve this smaller humanities-library setting with your instructor or student organization when a course-related film viewing or small-group session fits the plan.","short_summary":"A reservable, 12-seat multimedia and humanities-library space.","evidence_claim":"John Carroll describe